<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45148" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spūmĕus</span></b> , a, um,
			adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>foaming</i>, <i>frothy</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Nereus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 2, 419</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amnis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 2, 496</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">unda,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 10, 212</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">torrens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					3, 571</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aper,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart. 14, 221, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cumulus undarum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					9, 798</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Rhodanus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 11, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rabies per ora effluit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					5, 190</span></i>
			; cf.: salivae hominis, Prud. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 1, 101: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sucus malorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					15, 28, 33, § 109</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">semen heraclii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					20, 19, 79, § 207</span></i>
			: color equorum, <i>foamlike</i>, i. e. <i>dappled</i>, <i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 13,
				4</span></i>.</div>
